Bug reproduction log for POST /api/auth/login
============================================

Trigger:
- Request: POST /api/auth/login
- Payload: {"email":"test@example.com","password":"testpass123"}

Observed HTTP response:
- Status: 500 Internal Server Error
- Body: {"success":false,"error":"Internal server error"}

Server log:
[ERROR] POST /api/auth/login - Intentional login bug: forced token generation failure

Cause:
- The login route successfully validates the user and password.
- An intentional error is now thrown after validation to simulate a token-generation failure.
